---
---

<!-- 4. PROCESSUS DE CONCEPTION MOBILE -->
<section class="w-full px-8 lg:px-32 py-16 bg-white dark:bg-dark-bg">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-12">
        <div class="text-center space-y-4">
            <span class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-primary dark:text-brand-secondary uppercase">Méthodologie</span>
            <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-dark-bg dark:text-white">Du premier croquis au lancement sur les stores</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-xl mx-auto text-sm">
                Un processus éprouvé en 5 étapes pour concevoir une application mobile remarquable, sans imprévu ni dette technique.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-left">
            <!-- Step 1 -->
            <div class="bg-brand-surface dark:bg-brand-dark p-6 rounded-2xl border border-brand-light/20 dark:border-[#281E5A]/30 space-y-4 relative animate-on-scroll transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-brand-primary/30 dark:hover:border-brand-secondary/30">
                <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-primary text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">1</span>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark-bg dark:text-white">Cadrage & User Journey</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                    Analyse de vos utilisateurs cibles, identification des fonctionnalités essentielles (MVP) et cartographie logique du flux d'écrans pour éliminer toute étape inutile.
                </p>
                <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-brand-primary dark:text-brand-secondary font-medium">
                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-brand-primary/10">User flow</span>
                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-brand-primary/10">Architecture IA</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Step 2 -->
            <div class="bg-brand-surface dark:bg-brand-dark p-6 rounded-2xl border border-brand-light/20 dark:border-[#281E5A]/30 space-y-4 relative animate-on-scroll transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-brand-primary/30 dark:hover:border-brand-secondary/30" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
                <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-primary text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">2</span>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark-bg dark:text-white">Wireframes & Ergonomie Tactile</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                    Conception de la structure filaire en basse fidélité. Placement rigoureux de la navigation (Bottom Bar, Headers) et organisation de la zone de pouce pour une prise en main immédiate.
                </p>
                <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-brand-primary dark:text-brand-secondary font-medium">
                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-brand-primary/10">Thumb Zone</span>
                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-brand-primary/10">Bottom Sheets</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Step 3 -->
            <div class="bg-brand-surface dark:bg-brand-dark p-6 rounded-2xl border border-brand-light/20 dark:border-[#281E5A]/30 space-y-4 relative animate-on-scroll transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-brand-primary/30 dark:hover:border-brand-secondary/30" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
                <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-primary text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">3</span>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark-bg dark:text-white">UI Design Haute Fidélité</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                    Création de l'univers graphique complet sur Figma : typographies natives, palette de couleurs, contrastes validés, Dark Mode et variantes pour les différentes tailles d'écrans.
                </p>
                <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-brand-primary dark:text-brand-secondary font-medium">
                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-brand-primary/10">Dark Mode</span>
                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-brand-primary/10">iOS & Android</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Step 4 -->
            <div class="bg-brand-surface dark:bg-brand-dark p-6 rounded-2xl border border-brand-light/20 dark:border-[#281E5A]/30 space-y-4 relative animate-on-scroll transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-brand-primary/30 dark:hover:border-brand-secondary/30" style="transition-delay: 300ms;">
                <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-primary text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">4</span>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark-bg dark:text-white">Prototype Interactif Mobile</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                    Connexion des écrans avec de vraies interactions mobiles (swipes, modales, loaders). Vous testez l'application directement sur votre smartphone via l'app Figma Mirror avant d'écrire la moindre ligne de code.
                </p>
                <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-brand-primary dark:text-brand-secondary font-medium">
                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-brand-primary/10">Figma Mirror</span>
                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-brand-primary/10">Transitions réelles</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Step 5 -->
            <div class="bg-brand-surface dark:bg-brand-dark p-6 rounded-2xl border border-brand-light/20 dark:border-[#281E5A]/30 space-y-4 relative animate-on-scroll transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-lg hover:border-brand-primary/30 dark:hover:border-brand-secondary/30" style="transition-delay: 400ms;">
                <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-primary text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">5</span>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark-bg dark:text-white">Design System & Handoff Dev</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                    Livraison d'un fichier Figma ultra-organisé : composants réutilisables, styles de typographie et couleurs documentés, assets vectoriels exportés et réunion de passage de relais avec vos développeurs.
                </p>
                <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-brand-primary dark:text-brand-secondary font-medium">
                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-brand-primary/10">Tokens CSS</span>
                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-brand-primary/10">Zéro friction</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Step 6 : Bonus Accompagnement -->
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-primary/10 to-brand-secondary/10 dark:from-brand-primary/20 dark:to-brand-secondary/20 p-6 rounded-2xl border-2 border-dashed border-brand-primary/40 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 animate-on-scroll" style="transition-delay: 500ms;">
                <div class="space-y-3">
                    <div class="text-brand-primary dark:text-brand-secondary text-2xl font-bold">
                        <i class='bx bx-check-shield'></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark-bg dark:text-white">Support pendant l'intégration</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                        Je reste disponible pour répondre aux questions de votre équipe technique pendant le sprint de développement et vérifier la fidélité de l'intégration visuelle.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-brand-primary dark:text-brand-secondary">Assurance qualité garantie</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
